          "name": "Grafana Get Recording Rule Write Target",
          "request": {
            "name": "Grafana Get Recording Rule Write Target",
            "description": {
              "content": "This API operation retrieves the configured write target for recording rules in Grafana. When called using a GET request to the /recording-rules/writer endpoint, it returns information about where recording rule data is being written, which typically includes details about the remote write configuration or storage backend that has been set up to receive and store the results of recording rule evaluations. This is useful for administrators who need to verify or audit the destination of their recording rule outputs.",
